{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42384","headline":"奉和御制茱萸 · 徐铉","name":"奉和御制茱萸","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"台畔西风御果新，芳香精彩丽萧辰。\n柔条细叶妆治好，紫蔕红芳点缀匀。\n几朵得陪天上宴，千株长作洞中春。\n今朝圣藻偏流咏，黄菊无由更敢邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}